{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"dart","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.0.0","displayName":"Dart","description":"Syntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for Dart (.dart).","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Languages"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"languages":[{"id":"dart","name":"Dart","extensions":[".dart"],"grammar":"grammars/dart.json","lineComment":"//","blockComment":["/*","*/"]}],"snippets":[{"language":"Dart","path":"snippets/dart.json"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"grammars/dart.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"ignoreCase\": false,\n  \"rules\": [\n    {\n      \"begin\": \"\\\\/\\\\*\",\n      \"end\": \"\\\\*\\\\/\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\/\\\\/.*$\",\n      \"token\": \"comment\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"begin\": \"'''\",\n      \"end\": \"'''\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"begin\": \"\\\"\\\"\\\"\",\n      \"end\": \"\\\"\\\"\\\"\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\"(?:[^\\\"\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*\\\"\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"'(?:[^'\\\\\\\\]|\\\\\\\\.)*'\",\n      \"token\": \"string\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"@[A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_]*\",\n      \"token\": \"macro\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:0[xX][0-9a-fA-F_]+|0[bB][01_]+|0[oO][0-7_]+|\\\\d[\\\\d_]*(?:\\\\.\\\\d[\\\\d_]*)?(?:[eE][+-]?\\\\d+)?)[uUlLfFdDnNiI]{0,3}\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"number\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:implements|covariant|extension|interface|abstract|continue|deferred|external|Function|operator|required|default|dynamic|extends|factory|finally|library|rethrow|typedef|assert|export|import|return|sealed|static|switch|async|await|break|catch|class|const|final|mixin|super|throw|while|yield|base|case|else|enum|hide|late|part|show|sync|this|void|when|with|for|get|new|set|try|var|as|do|if|in|is|on)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"keyword\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:false|true|null)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"constant\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:Iterable|Duration|DateTime|dynamic|double|Object|String|Future|Stream|Never|bool|List|int|Map|num|Set)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"type\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b(?:runApp|print|main)\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"function\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b[A-Z][A-Za-z0-9_]*\\\\b\",\n      \"token\": \"type\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"match\": \"\\\\b[A-Za-z_][A-Za-z0-9_]*(?=\\\\s*\\\\()\",\n      \"token\": \"function\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"},"snippets/dart.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"Main\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"main\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"void main() {\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"The main function\"\n  },\n  \"Stateless widget\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"stless\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"class ${1:Name} extends StatelessWidget {\",\n      \"\\tconst ${1:Name}({super.key});\",\n      \"\",\n      \"\\t@override\",\n      \"\\tWidget build(BuildContext context) {\",\n      \"\\t\\treturn $0;\",\n      \"\\t}\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A Flutter stateless widget\"\n  },\n  \"Stateful widget\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"stful\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"class ${1:Name} extends StatefulWidget {\",\n      \"\\tconst ${1:Name}({super.key});\",\n      \"\",\n      \"\\t@override\",\n      \"\\tState<${1:Name}> createState() => _${1:Name}State();\",\n      \"}\",\n      \"\",\n      \"class _${1:Name}State extends State<${1:Name}> {\",\n      \"\\t@override\",\n      \"\\tWidget build(BuildContext context) {\",\n      \"\\t\\treturn $0;\",\n      \"\\t}\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A Flutter stateful widget\"\n  },\n  \"Class\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"class\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"class ${1:Name} {\",\n      \"\\t${2:Name}($3);\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"A class\"\n  },\n  \"Async function\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"afn\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"Future<${1:void}> ${2:name}() async {\",\n      \"\\t$0\",\n      \"}\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"An async function\"\n  },\n  \"Print\": {\n    \"prefix\": \"pr\",\n    \"body\": [\n      \"print('${1:value}');\"\n    ],\n    \"description\": \"print\"\n  }\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# Dart\n\nSyntax coloring, comment toggling and snippets for Dart.\n\n## Files\n\n`.dart`\n\n## Features\n\n- Colors keywords, types, strings, numbers, comments and more. The colors follow your theme.\n- **Toggle Line Comment** (Ctrl+/) uses `//`.\n- 6 snippets.\n\n## Snippets\n\nType the prefix and press Tab.\n\n| Prefix | What it inserts |\n| --- | --- |\n| `main` | The main function |\n| `stless` | A Flutter stateless widget |\n| `stful` | A Flutter stateful widget |\n| `class` | A class |\n| `afn` | An async function |\n| `pr` | print |\n\nThis extension runs no code and asks for no permissions. It is built with the [language contribution](https://ferrum.vyloxi.com/docs/languages) format.\n"}}}